        SystemStatistics::SystemStatistics_Collect: [global] Collect system statistics
        TerminationTrigger::TerminationTrigger_CheckWalltime: Check elapsed job walltime
        TerminationTrigger::TerminationTrigger_CheckSignal: Check if we received a termination signal
        TerminationTrigger::TerminationTrigger_CheckFile: Check termination file
        WaveExtractCPM::WavExtrCPM_ResetCurrDet: [global] Reset the value of the current_detector, needed for the while loop next
        while (WaveExtractCPM::current_detector)
          GROUP WavExtrCPM_CalcsAtDetector: Calculations done for each detector, we loop over the detectors
            WaveExtractCPM::WavExtrCPM_SetupSphere: [global] Setup sintheta, sinphi arrays
            WaveExtractCPM::WavExtrCPM_ProjectSphereCactusInterp: [global] Interpolate 3D quantities into 2D grid arrays (on the sphere), project onto sphere
            WaveExtractCPM::WavExtrCPM_MetricToSphericalBasis: [global] Interpolate 3D quantities into 2D grid arrays (on the sphere), project onto sphere
            WaveExtractCPM::WavExtrCPM_SchwarzMassRad: [global] Calculate Schwarzschild Radius and Mass and spherical background
            WaveExtractCPM::WavExtrCPM_SubtrSpherMetric: [global] Substract spherical background part of metric from metric
            WaveExtractCPM::WavExtrCPM_MoncriefQ: [global] Compute Moncrief Qeven, Qodd from Regge Wheeler quantities
            WaveExtractCPM::WavExtrCPM_WriteData: [global] Write out results to disk and stdout - one file for each detector and (l,m) mode
            WaveExtractCPM::WavExtrCPM_AdjustDetector: [global] Decrease current_detector, go the the next detector
            WaveExtractCPM::WavExtrCPM_TimerInfo: [global] Output Timer Info if requested
        end while
